08249040 rtc-command-return

The SDK function stores its command from r0 on entry, then uses r1 through
r5 and r7 for the bit loop. r0 retains the command.

The explicit form changed the ROM bytes. The guarded form passed the unit ROM check.

--- a/src/lib/rtc/Rtc_WriteCommandByte.c
+++ b/src/lib/rtc/Rtc_WriteCommandByte.c
@@ -14,3 +14,6 @@
         *(vu16 *)0x080000C4 = (bit << 1) | 5;
     }
+#ifdef UBFIX
+    return value; // preserve the inherited GBA return value
+#endif
 }
